<mujoco model="dual_arm_platform">
  <!-- Fixed dual-arm platform: column with two 7-DOF arms (no end effectors; parallel grippers are attached at the wrist flange sites at build time).
       Kinematics, inertias and limits from the manufacturer URDF (2026-03-11); elbow and right-shoulder-roll ranges corrected from logged robot data.
       Visual geoms: group 1, no contacts. Collision geoms: group 3. Sites: group 4. -->
